rage, and expected manifest hashes. No other review finding was identified.", type=outcome, description="Reviewer verdict, contract mismatch evidence, required rework, and independent gate results"); set_notes(TASK-260720-wajgn8, text="Review cycle 2026-07-20 — changes requested. All behavioral and deterministic validation gates pass, but common.schema.json publishes `$defs/buildCommand` while the accepted predecessor contract requires the versioned public fragment `$defs/buildCommandV6`; commandV6 and tests must reference the required key. Evidence and exact rework are attached in TASK-260720-wajgn8_review-verdict.md.")'"'" in /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator
